{
  "id": "turing-schnakenberg",
  "title": {
    "ja": "Turing不安定性：線形成長率と小振幅パターン",
    "en": "Turing instability: linear growth and small-amplitude patterns"
  },
  "method_ids": [
    "centered-difference",
    "rk4"
  ],
  "domains": [
    "biology",
    "diffusion"
  ],
  "summary": {
    "ja": "Schnakenberg型反応拡散で、一様平衡の安定性と拡散による選択モードの成長を行列指数で検証します。",
    "en": "Use a matrix exponential to validate stable homogeneous kinetics and diffusion-driven growth of a selected Schnakenberg mode."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "無次元a=0.1,b=0.9、平衡(1,0.9)、拡散係数(0.01,1)、周期k=2、初期振幅1e-4。線形t=1と非線形t=4の短い計算に限定します。",
    "en": "Dimensionless a=0.1,b=0.9, equilibrium(1,0.9), diffusivities(0.01,1), periodic k=2 and initial amplitude1e-4. Restrict runs to linear t=1 and nonlinear t=4."
  },
  "algorithm": {
    "ja": "独自の中心差分・RK4で線形化PDEと短い非線形PDEを進めます。3格子でのモード振幅と成長率、非線形の濃度最小値・初期パターン増幅を記録します。",
    "en": "Advance the linearized and short nonlinear PDEs using original centered differences/RK4. Record mode amplitudes/growth on three grids, minimum concentrations and early-pattern amplification."
  },
  "validation": {
    "ja": "連続Fourier行列J-k²DのSciPy expmと線形数値解を比較し空間収束を測定。非線形計算は半離散線形行列指数との小振幅差を測り、成熟模様の参照照合とは区別します。",
    "en": "Compare linear numerical fields with SciPy expm of continuum J-k²D and measure spatial convergence. Quantify the nonlinear run against a semidiscrete linear matrix exponential as a small-amplitude check, not validation of mature morphology."
  },
  "limits": {
    "ja": "1つの平衡近傍の発生段階です。原著係数や原著実験の再現、成熟模様、ランダム擾乱からの波数選択、実生物の較正は主張しません。",
    "en": "One near-equilibrium onset experiment. No claim reproduces original-paper parameters/experiments, mature patterns, wavenumber selection from random noise or biological calibration."
  },
  "formulas": [
    "u_t=D_u u_{xx}+a-u+u^2v,\\quad v_t=D_v v_{xx}+b-u^2v",
    "\\partial_t\\widehat{\\delta z}=(J-k^2D)\\widehat{\\delta z},\\quad \\widehat{\\delta z}(t)=e^{(J-k^2D)t}\\widehat{\\delta z}(0)"
  ],
